==English==

===Etymology===
Conventionalized sound of snoring.

===Pronunciation===
* {{qualifier|as spelled}} {{IPA|en|[zːːː]}}
* {{qualifier|imitation of snoring}} {{IPAfont|[ʩ𐞪]}} and similar
* {{audio|en|Zzz.ogg|a=US}}

===Interjection===
{{en-interj}}

# A snoring sound, implying that somebody is [[asleep]].

